# Keep this repository text-only.
# The live site (https://arogym.pages.dev) deploys optimized image and
# font binaries separately. Do not commit raster images, screenshots,
# video/audio, binary fonts, or archives.
# Small SVG marks under site/ are source and stay tracked.

# Raster images and screenshots
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.avif
*.gif
screens/

# Video and audio
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.aac

# Binary fonts (woff/woff2 plus desktop font files)
*.woff
*.woff2
*.ttf
*.otf
*.eot

# Archives
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.tar

# Versioned binary asset drops
assets-v*/
